{"language": "en", "duration": 288.79, "model": "faster-whisper:small", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.52, "text": "This is Aakash Vani, the newsreader by Aparajata Nair.", "words": [[0.0, 0.38, " This"], [0.38, 0.56, " is"], [0.56, 1.0, " Aakash"], [1.0, 1.3, " Vani,"], [1.84, 1.94, " the"], [1.94, 2.54, " newsreader"], [2.54, 2.64, " by"], [2.64, 3.26, " Aparajata"], [3.26, 3.52, " Nair."]]}, {"start": 12.58, "end": 18.2, "text": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi today inaugurated the 4-day Bharat Renewable Energy Summit and", "words": [[12.58, 12.94, " Prime"], [12.94, 13.32, " Minister"], [13.32, 13.8, " Narendra"], [13.8, 14.04, " Modi"], [14.04, 14.36, " today"], [14.36, 15.12, " inaugurated"], [15.12, 15.38, " the"], [15.38, 15.64, " 4"], [15.64, 15.8, "-day"], [15.8, 16.24, " Bharat"], [16.24, 16.86, " Renewable"], [16.86, 17.18, " Energy"], [17.18, 17.58, " Summit"], [17.58, 18.2, " and"]]}, {"start": 18.2, "end": 21.46, "text": "Expo 2026 at Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi.", "words": [[18.2, 18.62, " Expo"], [18.62, 19.46, " 2026"], [19.46, 20.04, " at"], [20.04, 20.4, " Bharat"], [20.4, 20.84, " Mandapam"], [20.84, 21.06, " in"], [21.06, 21.22, " New"], [21.22, 21.46, " Delhi."]]}, {"start": 21.98, "end": 26.56, "text": "The summit is being organised by the Ministry of New and Renewable Energy with the theme", "words": [[21.98, 22.16, " The"], [22.16, 22.4, " summit"], [22.4, 22.66, " is"], [22.66, 22.84, " being"], [22.84, 23.3, " organised"], [23.3, 23.66, " by"], [23.66, 23.82, " the"], [23.82, 24.1, " Ministry"], [24.1, 24.42, " of"], [24.42, 24.7, " New"], [24.7, 24.94, " and"], [24.94, 25.44, " Renewable"], [25.44, 25.84, " Energy"], [25.84, 26.2, " with"], [26.2, 26.32, " the"], [26.32, 26.56, " theme"]]}, {"start": 26.56, "end": 28.76, "text": "of Invest, Innovate, Inspire.", "words": [[26.56, 26.74, " of"], [26.74, 27.26, " Invest,"], [27.64, 28.08, " Innovate,"], [28.28, 28.76, " Inspire."]]}, {"start": 29.4, "end": 33.04, "text": "Mr Modi visited Stolls and interacted with the exhibitor at Expo.", "words": [[29.4, 29.58, " Mr"], [29.58, 29.88, " Modi"], [29.88, 30.22, " visited"], [30.22, 30.84, " Stolls"], [30.84, 30.9, " and"], [30.9, 31.28, " interacted"], [31.28, 31.66, " with"], [31.66, 31.76, " the"], [31.76, 32.28, " exhibitor"], [32.28, 32.54, " at"], [32.54, 33.04, " Expo."]]}, {"start": 33.04, "end": 37.52, "text": "Addressing the gathering, Mr Modi said, the global economy has witnessed", "words": [[33.04, 33.98, " Addressing"], [33.98, 34.18, " the"], [34.18, 34.5, " gathering,"], [34.8, 34.96, " Mr"], [34.96, 35.22, " Modi"], [35.22, 35.56, " said,"], [36.04, 36.12, " the"], [36.12, 36.36, " global"], [36.36, 36.92, " economy"], [36.92, 37.2, " has"], [37.2, 37.52, " witnessed"]]}, {"start": 37.52, "end": 43.38, "text": "unprecedented crisis over the past few years. Mr Modi added that despite this", "words": [[37.52, 38.28, " unprecedented"], [38.28, 38.92, " crisis"], [38.92, 39.56, " over"], [39.56, 39.68, " the"], [39.68, 39.94, " past"], [39.94, 40.18, " few"], [40.18, 40.48, " years."], [41.04, 41.28, " Mr"], [41.28, 41.6, " Modi"], [41.6, 41.9, " added"], [41.9, 42.48, " that"], [42.48, 42.86, " despite"], [42.86, 43.38, " this"]]}, {"start": 43.38, "end": 48.46, "text": "crisis, India has sustained high growth. Prime Minister Modi said that this", "words": [[43.38, 43.86, " crisis,"], [44.34, 44.52, " India"], [44.52, 44.76, " has"], [44.76, 45.2, " sustained"], [45.2, 45.56, " high"], [45.56, 45.94, " growth."], [46.38, 46.7, " Prime"], [46.7, 46.98, " Minister"], [46.98, 47.32, " Modi"], [47.32, 47.68, " said"], [47.68, 48.26, " that"], [48.26, 48.46, " this"]]}, {"start": 48.46, "end": 53.46, "text": "global crisis has sent a clear message that energy security is directly linked", "words": [[48.46, 48.78, " global"], [48.78, 49.3, " crisis"], [49.3, 49.62, " has"], [49.62, 49.94, " sent"], [49.94, 50.16, " a"], [50.16, 50.36, " clear"], [50.36, 50.74, " message"], [50.74, 51.46, " t